# Astra frontend

Follow `apps/web/design.md`. Chrome is black/white. Story sections use one pastel color block (`lime` intake, `cream` graph, `coral` attack, `lilac` timeline, `mint` remediate, `navy` failure). Return to white canvas between blocks.

## Buttons

- Text CTAs are pills (`border-radius: 50px`). Icon buttons are 40px circles.
- Primary: black fill, white text. Secondary: white fill, black text, no border.
- Magenta only for optional Sarvam explain, once per page.
- No square buttons, gradients, glow, or drop shadows on color blocks.

## Product truth

- Package `id` is the node key; `purl` is version identity. Never collapse instances by name.
- Remediation is a proposal (`verified: false`). Timeline is unavailable until history exists.
- Unknown is unknown. Do not use mid-gray body copy; hierarchy is Inter weight.
- JetBrains Mono is eyebrows/captions only, uppercase.
- Fetch via `/api/v1/*` (Next proxy). Never put `ASTRA_API_TOKEN` in client bundles or query strings.
